      "props": {
        "id": "Text-43305cf1-9d72-4341-bf82-a97d336018ba",
        "text": "<p>This project was done with \"This and That\" studio to develop their Kaantha cushion cover collection. This collection focused on exploring the kaantha embroidery done by the kutchi women of Gujarat, on khadi. The set consists of 6 main designs with various density and sizes of stitches repeated in various color combinations.</p>",
